        <mxCell id="notes-h-commands" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="Commands" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="400" x="20" y="1080" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes-commands-0" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;onboard-project&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(type: onboard issue)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left:16px;margin:4px 0 0 0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Claims the issue (ready → in-progress), branches aisf/&amp;lt;n&amp;gt;-…&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fills each project slot: migrates CLAUDE.md, README and old skills, scans the repo, asks the owner, suggests best practices&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;First asks: has the project a frontend? Yes → also drafts project-design and the visual-rendering recipe&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Runs analyze and test once from the draft toolchain; failures shown as findings, repo code never edited&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;One review page: confirm or edit every section until all are confirmed; resumes from a ledger&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Writes the slots to .claude/skills/, commits with plain git (commit/tdd/review need slots), PR via pr skill → in-review&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Accepted suggestions that need code → posted as bare ideas&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="355" width="340" x="20" y="1120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes-commands-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;create-ticket&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(idea: open issue, no status label)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left:16px;margin:4px 0 0 0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Infers the type (bug, enhancement, task, ui) and asks that type&#x27;s question track&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Asks what and why, never how&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rounds on one page: questionnaire pattern, one question-builder per question, round-builder per round, no header&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Idea is really several tickets → proposes a split; extra parts become bare ideas&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Last round: summary (title, context, scope, criteria, type, priority) and a &#x27;Plan next&#x27; switch&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rewrites the issue in place → backlog or plan; a ui idea stays an idea for design&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Never starts plan-ticket itself&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="355" width="340" x="390" y="1120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes-commands-2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;plan-ticket&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(status: plan)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left:16px;margin:4px 0 0 0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Checks the ticket has an outcome and acceptance criteria; else comments the gaps, sends it back to idea&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Research agents fetch facts (code, web) into a findings log; scope = only what a criterion needs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Decides in phases: UI → modules → inbound contract → business logic → outbound ports and data&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Interviews via questionnaire: no recommendations, pushes back once; precedent decisions shown as settled rows&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Needs hands-on experience → posts a spike and stops until its verdict&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Several independent features → splits the ticket into part tickets under an umbrella&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Splits work: one UI sub-issue + backend sub-issues, one module and layer each; critic agent; Confirm round with hitl flags&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Writes the Technical plan to the ticket, posts each spec as a ready sub-issue → parent planned (one PR → ready)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="355" width="340" x="760" y="1120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes-commands-3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;spike&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(type: spike sub-issue)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left:16px;margin:4px 0 0 0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Takes the options and the settling result from the spike body&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Builds the least throwaway code that settles them, on aisf/&amp;lt;n&amp;gt;-spike; no TDD, no review, no checks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;hitl → the human judges the result; otherwise runs it itself&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Writes Verdict, Evidence, Caveats into the parent&#x27;s &#x27;Planning so far&#x27;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;One local commit, never pushed, no PR; closes the spike; plan-ticket resumes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="226" width="340" x="20" y="1495" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes-commands-4" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;design&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(type: ui idea)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left:16px;margin:4px 0 0 0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Needs the project-design slot (tokens, fonts, icons, components)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Draws HTML boards at real size in .aisf/artifacts/design/: tokens.css + one board per screen or state, light and dark&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Real content, every domain state (empty, loading, error); new tokens marked and justified&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Human pins comments on the board page → edits boards, answers each comment, republishes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;On Accept: writes a ## Design section into the issue, idea → plan&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="226" width="340" x="390" y="1495" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes-commands-5" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;ui-ticket&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(designed type: ui ticket, status: plan)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left:16px;margin:4px 0 0 0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Reads the accepted boards; one leaf per data-part component, containers first&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Researches per component where it lands, what it replaces, which data feeds it&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Writes each leaf&#x27;s description (layout, sizes, tokens, states) and a mock in design/mocks/&amp;lt;part&amp;gt;.html&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Asks on one page only about pieces the app can&#x27;t back: scrap, update or blocking ticket&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Checks coverage and no invented numbers, posts blocking tickets then ready leaves → parent planned&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="226" width="340" x="760" y="1495" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes-commands-6" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;implement-ticket&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(ready leaf (not spike / ui / onboard))&lt;/i&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left:16px;margin:4px 0 0 0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Builds only from the ticket&#x27;s spec; a planned parent → lists its ready children and stops&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Claims (ready → in-progress), branches aisf/&amp;lt;n&amp;gt;-…&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Strict TDD inside Scope; hidden dependency → blocker + park&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Green: test + analyze clean, 5 tries then escalate&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;review-code agent with only the spec; evidence for every criterion (test, command, or human checkpoint if hitl)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;review simplicity → commit → push → PR via pr skill → in-review&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Also resumes, and reworks a PR with new review comments or conflicts; never merges&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="277" width="340" x="20" y="1741" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes-commands-7" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;ui-implement-ticket&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(ready type: ui leaf)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left:16px;margin:4px 0 0 0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Follows implement-ticket for claim, green, code review, simplicity, commit and PR&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Needs project-design, the visual-rendering recipe and the leaf&#x27;s mock&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;TDD only for behaviour (clicks, state, navigation); never asserts geometry&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Render loop: each state in light and dark to .aisf/images, compare with the mock, adjust&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Evidence = per-line verdict; open differences go to Merge danger; images never committed&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="277" width="340" x="390" y="1741" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes-h-skills" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="Skills" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="400" x="20" y="2058" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes-skills-0" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;github-issue&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(called by every command)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left:16px;margin:4px 0 0 0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;The only way to write issues: create, edit an idea in place, bare ideas, sub-issues, split parts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Defines ticket anatomy and the cold-read test&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Owns the labels: type, priority, status, plus hitl / waiting / stuck; never creates labels&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Guarded status changes: checks the expected state first, mismatch → stop&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Relations via native --parent and --blocked-by&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="181" width="340" x="20" y="2098" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes-skills-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;questionnaire&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(pattern for page interviews)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left:16px;margin:4px 0 0 0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Maps decisions as a design tree; each round asks the whole frontier&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;One page per session; ledger.md = answers, findings.md = facts; resume reads both&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Names the agents: question-builder, playback-builder, round-builder&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;No card recommends an answer&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="181" width="340" x="390" y="2098" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes-skills-2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;artifacts&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(bridge page rules)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left:16px;margin:4px 0 0 0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Page built from &amp;lt;aisf-*&amp;gt; elements: round, question, card, confirm, task, figure, playback&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shown with aisf_show_artifact; same id = next round on the same page&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Reads the answer event (submit, confirm, reopen) or plain text&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;No remote resources, no localStorage; the kit owns styling and state&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="181" width="340" x="760" y="2098" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes-skills-3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;tdd&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(test first)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left:16px;margin:4px 0 0 0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Red → Green → Refactor, one behaviour per cycle&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Commands, test layout and naming from project-testing and project-toolchain&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Tests isolated, deterministic, assert outcomes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Only changes project-testing declares untestable may skip Red, with proof in the PR&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="178" width="340" x="20" y="2299" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes-skills-4" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;review simplicity&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(after criteria, before commit)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left:16px;margin:4px 0 0 0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Launches simplicity-reviewer agents in parallel on the diff&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Angles: reuse, simplification, efficiency, altitude; architecture; bugs and gaps&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Applies only fixes certain to change nothing; reruns tests; reverts a fix that breaks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Architecture breaches → back to the caller as must-fix; bugs and gaps → reported only&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="178" width="340" x="390" y="2299" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes-skills-5" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;commit&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(conventional commit)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left:16px;margin:4px 0 0 0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Runs format, then analyze; fixes warnings in its own files; errors stop the commit&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Never stages secrets (.env, keys, credentials)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Picks type and scope from paths and history; adds the ticket ref&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Refreshes project-index if present; stages explicit files, commits, checks the tree is clean&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="178" width="340" x="760" y="2299" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes-skills-6" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;pr&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(PR body)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left:16px;margin:4px 0 0 0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Summary: a diagram, diff sketch or tree&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Evidence: before / after&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Merge danger: one-way or two-way door, blast radius&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Used by implement-ticket, ui-implement-ticket and onboard-project&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="133" width="340" x="20" y="2497" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes-h-agents" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="Agents" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="400" x="20" y="2670" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes-agents-0" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;playback-builder&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(page header)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left:16px;margin:4px 0 0 0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Writes the header: end-state paragraph + playback map&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Map: each acceptance criterion as a path through the public functions it touches, marked new / changed / untouched / removed&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Round 1 drafts from ticket, findings and code; later rounds sync it to the ledger&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Only writes playback.json and header.html; used by plan-ticket&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="193" width="340" x="20" y="2710" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes-agents-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;question-builder&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(one card)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left:16px;margin:4px 0 0 0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Reads ledger and findings; researches only missing facts (code, web), appends them to findings&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Classifies: settled by precedent (row), split (several decisions) or card&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Card: question, definitions, 1–3 visuals, options with gain / cost / effect&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Never recommends; checks the render headless at 1440 and 1920 px&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="193" width="340" x="390" y="2710" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes-agents-2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;round-builder&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(one round)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left:16px;margin:4px 0 0 0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Runs build-page.mjs: cards + settled rows, or the Confirm round (tasks, summary), into index.html&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Writes nothing itself; on error returns the reason, no repair&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="193" width="340" x="760" y="2710" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes-agents-3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;simplicity reviewer&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(read-only)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left:16px;margin:4px 0 0 0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Gets the diff and its angles from review simplicity&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Per finding: file, line, category, summary, safe to auto-apply or not&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Only what the diff introduces; never edits&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="196" width="340" x="20" y="2923" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes-agents-4" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;code-review (review-code)&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(architecture fixer)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left:16px;margin:4px 0 0 0&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Gets only the spec, reads the diff&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Checks every rule of project-architecture and code-rules against each changed line&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fixes breaches itself, keeps behaviour and tests green; reverts a fix it can&#x27;t land green&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Architecture beats spec → reports deviations (contract ones flagged)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Returns Fixed / Deviates from spec / Unresolved; never commits&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="196" width="340" x="390" y="2923" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
